      "hash": "cf2ddf7ee5ed0981",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 3]"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_01",
      "hash": "31286df728b1b018",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLUE: So you’re my first challenger,\\nhuh, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_02",
      "hash": "312870f728b1b531",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "That’s what I like to hear!\\nHere I go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0905_dummy_02",
      "hash": "3ce78b6f47fb37f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_03",
      "hash": "31286ff728b1b37e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLUE: Hmph. Your loss, I guess."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_04",
      "hash": "312872f728b1b897",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "BLUE: Oh, man!\\nSo you really are ready for Team Rocket!\\c\\nI feel pretty good about leaving this place in\\nyour hands!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0905_red_03",
      "hash": "cf2dde7ee5ed07ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0905_sys_02",
      "hash": "b0a05f3c3ff2a7a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0905_green_05",
      "hash": "312871f728b1b6e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Then you’re next, [VAR TRNAME(0001)]!\\nCome at me—I’m just getting warmed up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0905_rival_01",
      "hash": "ab975143120cf9bd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0905_rival_02",
      "hash": "ab974e43120cf4a4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR RIVALNAME(0001)]: Aw, jeez...\\nJust watching your battle made me nervous...\\c\\nDid you see his Pokémon’s eyes?\\nThey blew me away...but I’m not backing down!\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)], you go on ahead!\\nI’ll be right behind you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0905_stafff_01",
      "hash": "0dd0da442d90e603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "RECEPTIONIST: Blue is a famously strong\\nTrainer, you know...\\c\\nAnd he didn’t look like he was holding back\\nmuch, either.\\c\\nYou must be pretty special yourself!\\nI hope you really can save Silph!"
    }
  ],
